                     sediment mark tinted secondary, then the "Σύρτις"
                     wordmark in the brand accent. The mark is
                     Assets/syrtis-disc.svg, the same artwork as macOS
                     brandmark.pdf, flattened to one path in a 100-wide box;
                     a Path rather than an image so it takes the theme's
                     secondary text color, as macOS renders its PDF as a
                     template tinted .secondary. -->
